1
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:08,360
=Episode 10=

2
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:10,639
I'm so mad!

3
00:00:10,759 --> 00:00:12,240
He was perfectly fine one second,

4
00:00:12,879 --> 00:00:14,679
then snapped at me the next.

5
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:17,119
So what about the Huyun Deity?

6
00:00:17,519 --> 00:00:18,919
What superstitious nonsense.

7
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:22,640
Calm down. Calm down.

8
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:24,280
Getting angry will make me ugly.

9
00:00:30,879 --> 00:00:34,000
Jin Yunlie grew up in Huyun.

10
00:00:34,320 --> 00:00:35,800
His world isn't like mine.

11
00:00:36,440 --> 00:00:37,960
Then, was my attitude today

12
00:00:38,240 --> 00:00:40,119
a little over the top?

13
00:00:42,520 --> 00:00:43,240
Your Highness.

14
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:44,920
As you instructed,

15
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,479
Xiaoyan's mother's funeral
has been handled.

16
00:00:49,079 --> 00:00:49,880
Wait.

17
00:00:52,679 --> 00:00:53,880
Go see

18
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:55,840
if Xi Yuan has eaten today.

19
00:00:56,240 --> 00:00:57,240
Find out how many meals she's had

20
00:00:57,240 --> 00:00:58,159
and how much she ate.

21
00:00:58,759 --> 00:00:59,719
Then report back to me.

22
00:01:00,920 --> 00:01:01,359
Remember,

23
00:01:01,880 --> 00:01:02,679
be discreet.

24
00:01:03,119 --> 00:01:04,159
Discreet?

25
00:01:05,359 --> 00:01:06,240
Oh.

26
00:01:06,640 --> 00:01:08,439
Did you fight with Miss Xi Yuan?

27
00:01:08,439 --> 00:01:09,960
I... I didn't.

28
00:01:09,960 --> 00:01:10,760
Really?

29
00:01:11,560 --> 00:01:13,599
The mother and daughter
were so happy together.

30
00:01:13,599 --> 00:01:15,920
She was still thinking about
making her daughter's birthday noodles.

31
00:01:16,040 --> 00:01:16,840
Jin Yunlie,

32
00:01:17,159 --> 00:01:19,120
is breaking a taboo
all you care about right now?

33
00:01:19,560 --> 00:01:20,280
A girl just lost

34
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:22,680
her entire family
because she faithfully obeyed

35
00:01:22,680 --> 00:01:24,079
the laws you speak of!

36
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:25,920
I think...

37
00:01:27,760 --> 00:01:29,040
I really made her angry.

38
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:32,239
(Where's the model I told you
to get for your brother?)

39
00:01:32,959 --> 00:01:34,280
(You can't do anything right.)

40
00:01:34,280 --> 00:01:35,239
(You're good for nothing.)

41
00:01:35,719 --> 00:01:37,159
(Go buy it for him now.)

42
00:01:38,760 --> 00:01:39,599
(She watched)

43
00:01:39,599 --> 00:01:41,359
(the happiness she never had)

44
00:01:42,079 --> 00:01:43,799
(be torn apart before her eyes.)

45
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:47,200
(I shouldn't have raised my voice
earlier.)

46
00:01:48,359 --> 00:01:49,799
(How should I apologize?)

47
00:01:50,159 --> 00:01:52,640
When a girl's mad,
you've got to make her happy.

48
00:02:00,079 --> 00:02:00,879
I've got it.

49
00:02:00,920 --> 00:02:02,560
(Xi Yuan must still be angry.)

50
00:02:02,719 --> 00:02:03,840
(What if she doesn't want to see me?)

51
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:05,840
(But I'm the only one she has now.)

52
00:02:06,040 --> 00:02:07,000
(If I don't go to her)

53
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:08,359
(won't she get even angrier?)

54
00:02:08,799 --> 00:02:10,599
(What if she needs time alone?)

55
00:02:10,799 --> 00:02:11,719
(But what if she calms down)

56
00:02:11,719 --> 00:02:14,000
(and realizes we're worlds apart?)

57
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:15,240
(It's fine.)

58
00:02:15,719 --> 00:02:17,159
(She won't have the heart to leave me.)

59
00:02:17,639 --> 00:02:18,919
(But what if she does?)

60
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:20,360
(Forget it.)

61
00:02:28,039 --> 00:02:30,639
Should I apologize to him?

62
00:02:33,879 --> 00:02:34,599
Whatever. I'm going.

63
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:37,919
A lady knows when to swallow her pride.

64
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:39,039
Time to go.

65
00:02:53,439 --> 00:02:54,520
Why are you here?

66
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:55,919
Oh.

67
00:03:00,479 --> 00:03:01,400
This...

68
00:03:02,159 --> 00:03:02,680
It's...

69
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:04,080
ice cream?

70
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:05,599
Mm.

71
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:06,919
For me?

72
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:10,240
I made it myself.

73
00:03:12,759 --> 00:03:13,840
Thank you.

74
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:23,199
I can't believe there's ice cream here.

75
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:24,400
Try it.

76
00:03:25,080 --> 00:03:26,000
If you like it,

77
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:28,680
I'll make more.

78
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:34,599
Jin Yunlie.

79
00:03:35,439 --> 00:03:36,800
Why did you...

80
00:03:38,719 --> 00:03:39,759
I thought about

81
00:03:40,639 --> 00:03:41,680
what happened earlier.

82
00:03:42,599 --> 00:03:44,120
I raised my voice at you.

83
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:45,759
No, I was wrong.

84
00:03:45,759 --> 00:03:46,560
No, no.

85
00:03:46,719 --> 00:03:47,719
It was my fault.

86
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:50,240
You watched a happy little family

87
00:03:51,439 --> 00:03:52,120
fall apart.

88
00:03:53,199 --> 00:03:54,639
That must've been hard for you.

89
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:58,520
I was wrong too.

90
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:00,159
I'm new to Huyun

91
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:01,360
and don't know its rules.

92
00:04:01,520 --> 00:04:03,080
You stopped me from speaking up

93
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:05,680
because you were trying to protect me.

94
00:04:08,639 --> 00:04:09,439
So...

95
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:11,840
you're not angry anymore?

96
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:14,759
Mm.

97
00:04:16,759 --> 00:04:17,599
Then try the ice cream.

98
00:04:18,439 --> 00:04:19,120
Okay.

99
00:04:37,920 --> 00:04:39,199
This ice cream...

100
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:41,639
is a little spicy.

101
00:04:42,160 --> 00:04:42,639
It is.

102
00:04:43,199 --> 00:04:44,240
I made it with green radish.

103
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:45,319
What do you think?

104
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:49,839
It's... quite unique.

105
00:04:54,279 --> 00:04:55,240
Good.

106
00:04:59,839 --> 00:05:00,639
Then...

107
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:02,040
enjoy.

108
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:39,959
Jin Yunlie really has his moments.

109
00:05:40,279 --> 00:05:42,600
The Crown Prince of Huyun

110
00:05:43,160 --> 00:05:44,480
actually apologized to me first.

111
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:45,519
Not bad.

112
00:05:48,279 --> 00:05:48,839
Shisi.

113
00:05:49,399 --> 00:05:50,560
Let's agree on something.

114
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:51,639
Next time you appear,

115
00:05:51,839 --> 00:05:53,480
give me a heads-up first, okay?

116
00:05:54,399 --> 00:05:55,120
Was the ice cream

117
00:05:55,639 --> 00:05:56,360
good?

118
00:05:58,920 --> 00:05:59,600
Yes.

119
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:04,079
You're treating a radish
like it's treasure.

120
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:05,000
Clearly,

121
00:06:05,439 --> 00:06:06,519
you care a lot about him.

122
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:07,839
Who cares about him?

123
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:10,319
We're from two different worlds.

124
00:06:10,519 --> 00:06:12,000
We have nothing to do with each other.

125
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:14,199
Nothing to do with each other?

126
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:17,399
Then if his life were in danger,

127
00:06:17,759 --> 00:06:18,759
would you save him?

128
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:21,040
What do you mean?

129
00:06:21,759 --> 00:06:23,399
Yellow Dragon recently predicted

130
00:06:23,959 --> 00:06:26,199
that Jin Yunlie would soon face

131
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:27,879
a life-or-death tribulation.

132
00:06:28,759 --> 00:06:29,399
When that happens,

133
00:06:30,279 --> 00:06:31,519
if he dies,

134
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:34,680
would you still be this calm

135
00:06:35,319 --> 00:06:36,279
and completely unaffected?

136
00:06:36,920 --> 00:06:37,560
Wait.

137
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:38,639
Who's Yellow Dragon?

138
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:39,959
Are his readings accurate?

139
00:06:40,399 --> 00:06:41,519
(Whether it's true or not,)

140
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:43,800
(I'm just letting you know.)

141
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:52,920
A life-or-death tribulation?

142
00:07:04,959 --> 00:07:07,120
(Jin Yunlie will soon face)

143
00:07:07,199 --> 00:07:08,839
(a life-or-death tribulation.)

144
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:11,759
(When that happens, if he dies,)

145
00:07:12,079 --> 00:07:14,639
(would you still be this calm)

146
00:07:14,959 --> 00:07:15,959
(and completely unmoved?)

147
00:07:16,519 --> 00:07:17,800
Completely calm?

148
00:07:18,519 --> 00:07:19,759
Of course not.

149
00:07:20,319 --> 00:07:23,319
I need him alive to get the Xuanji Jade.

150
00:07:24,839 --> 00:07:25,759
Yunlie.

151
00:07:26,040 --> 00:07:27,879
Please say yes.

152
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:32,720
Yunlie.

153
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:34,800
Please, do me this favor.

154
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:35,519
No.

155
00:07:35,639 --> 00:07:36,160
(That voice...)

156
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:39,000
Let me take Xi Yuan to Xuanhan.

157
00:07:41,519 --> 00:07:42,879
It's only been a few days,

158
00:07:43,079 --> 00:07:43,920
and you're already so protective.

159
00:07:46,279 --> 00:07:47,720
We've been close since childhood.

160
00:07:47,720 --> 00:07:49,120
Don't you trust me?

161
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:50,399
Yunlie.

162
00:07:50,759 --> 00:07:52,720
Please say yes.

163
00:07:52,839 --> 00:07:55,199
(The Princess of Xuanhan?)

164
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:57,040
Stop!

165
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:01,399
Xi Yuan.

166
00:08:02,959 --> 00:08:03,800
What do you want?

167
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:05,399
Xi Yuan!

168
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:11,199
Xi Yuan.

169
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:13,439
What do you want?

170
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:16,199
Xi Yuan!

171
00:08:23,199 --> 00:08:24,160
I finally get to meet you!

172
00:08:26,079 --> 00:08:26,839
Who are you?

173
00:08:26,839 --> 00:08:27,839
I'm Xuan Yazhe.

174
00:08:32,959 --> 00:08:34,120
I'm your sasaeng fan.

175
00:08:34,639 --> 00:08:35,360
What?

176
00:08:35,759 --> 00:08:36,480
A sasaeng fan?

177
00:08:38,759 --> 00:08:40,519
Are you also...

178
00:08:40,519 --> 00:08:42,399
Let's talk in private.

179
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:48,080
What are you trying to pull now?

180
00:08:48,559 --> 00:08:49,360
Your Highness.

181
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:51,039
His Majesty summons you.

182
00:08:52,639 --> 00:08:53,360
Go, go.

183
00:08:53,360 --> 00:08:54,559
Hurry, hurry!

184
00:08:59,320 --> 00:09:00,559
You're from the modern world too?

185
00:09:00,639 --> 00:09:01,879
Who's assigned to guide you?

186
00:09:07,080 --> 00:09:08,240
(Xuan Yazhe, Male, 18
Crown Prince of Xuanhan)

187
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:08,840
(Spiritual Element: Water)
Xi Yuan!

188
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:11,519
(Specialty: Defense)
I was born and raised in Xuanhan.

189
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:15,279
Wait, you're a guy?

190
00:09:18,639 --> 00:09:19,399
I have one too.

191
00:09:22,159 --> 00:09:23,159
How come you have a phone?

192
00:09:25,840 --> 00:09:28,240
Lord Yellow Dragon gave it to me.

193
00:09:28,679 --> 00:09:29,720
It lets me

194
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:31,440
see everything in your world.

195
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:33,320
Everything from...

196
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:34,679
(Shisi mentioned Yellow Dragon too.)

197
00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:37,440
(Could he be Xuan Yazhe's guide?)

198
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:38,200
Your birth,

199
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:39,320
elementary school,

200
00:09:39,679 --> 00:09:40,440
middle school, high school...

201
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:41,240
Wait.

202
00:09:43,279 --> 00:09:44,440
You mean

203
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:49,399
you've been watching me through
this phone for nearly 20 years?

204
00:09:49,399 --> 00:09:50,039
Yes.

205
00:09:50,039 --> 00:09:51,360
That's why I know you so well.

206
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:55,960
Xuan Yazhe!

207
00:09:57,080 --> 00:09:58,120
I'm warning you!

208
00:09:58,279 --> 00:09:59,720
You're officially expelled
from my fandom.

209
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:02,039
Stop using that thing to spy on me.

210
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:07,000
Fine, I won't watch anymore.

211
00:10:07,360 --> 00:10:09,320
Ever since you came here,

212
00:10:09,639 --> 00:10:11,000
I can't see your life back there anyway.

213
00:10:11,639 --> 00:10:12,519
But...

214
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:15,519
could you help me with something?

215
00:10:16,519 --> 00:10:17,240
What is it?

216
00:10:19,159 --> 00:10:21,120
Xuanhan is bitterly cold.

217
00:10:21,559 --> 00:10:23,440
Crops can't survive the winter.

218
00:10:23,919 --> 00:10:25,120
I saw on the phone

219
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:26,080
that your world

220
00:10:26,440 --> 00:10:27,519
has advanced technology

221
00:10:27,840 --> 00:10:30,039
that keeps crops alive in winter.

222
00:10:30,919 --> 00:10:31,559
So...

223
00:10:32,679 --> 00:10:33,960
can you teach me how to farm?

224
00:10:34,399 --> 00:10:35,080
Farm?

225
00:10:35,320 --> 00:10:35,960
Mm.

226
00:10:37,919 --> 00:10:40,240
Yunlie knows more about farming than me.

227
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:41,159
Go ask him.

228
00:10:42,440 --> 00:10:43,159
Be good, okay?

229
00:10:48,120 --> 00:10:49,720
Since when can Yunlie farm?

230
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:50,399
You wretch!

231
00:10:50,720 --> 00:10:52,440
You still allow her to stay in Huyun?

232
00:10:53,080 --> 00:10:54,360
If Father wishes to punish me,

233
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:56,399
I won't complain.

234
00:10:58,039 --> 00:10:59,360
But Xi Yuan is innocent.

235
00:11:00,679 --> 00:11:03,120
Please show her mercy, Father.

236
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:04,440
Innocent?

237
00:11:04,440 --> 00:11:06,159
This lofty Huyun Deity you speak of?

238
00:11:06,320 --> 00:11:07,480
All I see is someone

239
00:11:07,480 --> 00:11:09,679
who endlessly demands
spirit-stone offerings from his people.

240
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:10,879
Xi Yuan!

241
00:11:11,039 --> 00:11:12,720
When she slandered the Huyun Deity,

242
00:11:12,720 --> 00:11:14,000
did she consider the consequences?

243
00:11:14,519 --> 00:11:15,919
A woman who shows contempt for a deity

244
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,080
deserves death.

245
00:11:17,559 --> 00:11:18,720
I order you

246
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:20,159
to break off your engagement with her,

247
00:11:20,440 --> 00:11:21,399
and kill her.

248
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:26,159
I cannot obey, Father.

249
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:30,080
Xi Yuan saved my life
when I was in danger,

250
00:11:30,080 --> 00:11:31,039
and she won the Martial Trial.

251
00:11:31,159 --> 00:11:31,919
By all rights,

252
00:11:31,919 --> 00:11:33,679
she deserves to be Crown Princess.

253
00:11:34,159 --> 00:11:35,080
I won't kill her.

254
00:11:35,919 --> 00:11:37,200
Nor can I go back on my word now

255
00:11:37,200 --> 00:11:38,320
and betray both duty and honor.

256
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:39,759
Insolence!

257
00:11:45,799 --> 00:11:47,360
(Don't hurt Yunlie.)

258
00:11:50,920 --> 00:11:56,520
♪A love letter, a passionate pursuit,
the envy of everyone♪

259
00:11:57,720 --> 00:12:03,320
♪Bouquets and heartfelt confessions,
leaving me moved and fulfilled♪

260
00:12:04,520 --> 00:12:10,120
♪No matter how long or hard our road,
I don't care♪

261
00:12:10,360 --> 00:12:16,920
♪But you left me with this pain,
forever beyond redemption♪
